// Regla Sigma: proc_creation_win_speechruntime_child_process.yml
// ID Sigma: 78f10490-f2f4-4d19-a75b-4e0683bf3b8d
// Título: Suspicious Speech Runtime Binary Child Process
// Descripción: Detects suspicious Speech Runtime Binary Execution by monitoring its child processes.
Child processes spawned by SpeechRuntime.exe could indicate an attempt for lateral movement via COM & DCOM hijacking.

// Aplica a: Producto: windows | Categoría: process_creation
// Producto: windows
// Categoría: process_creation
// Servicio: 
// Nivel: high
// Pipeline: microsoft_xdr
// Ruta original: C:\SigmaLab\sigma\rules\windows\process_creation\proc_creation_win_speechruntime_child_process.yml
// Requiere validación en el entorno de destino.

DeviceProcessEvents
| where InitiatingProcessFolderPath endswith "\\SpeechRuntime.exe"
